Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=12}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] So, you are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:59.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The unrivaled pirate captain\Nwho was also the ship's cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.89,0:02:02.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right, I'm still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But what has any of this\Ngot to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't been a pirate\Nfor many years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:10.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I chose the life of a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:12.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:15.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Chose the life of a cook," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You didn't have a choice, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:23.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You live as a cook because the {\i1}only{\i0}\Nthing you can be now is a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:25.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was known far and wide...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:30.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Red Foot Zeff was a master of deadly\Nkicks who never used his hands in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was said that with his mighty legs,\Nhe could crush bedrock to sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.43,0:02:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and leave footprints on solid steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:41.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Red Foot" referred to his\Nboots which became soaked
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:46.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1982)}in the blood of his enemies\Nas he kicked them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You know, it really is a pity that you no\Nlonger have that precious leg of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard that rumor some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:03:00.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How unlucky for you to have\Nsuch an accident at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:03.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that your greatest weapon\Nhas been sacrificed to the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're defenseless,\Ncompletely unable to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] I don't need to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:09.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And as long as I have my two\Nhands for that, I'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough chitchat,\Nlet's get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Red... Foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:22.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the man who\Nsailed the perilous waters
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Grand Line and\Ncame back unscathed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There should be a logbook\Ndetailing your tactics,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a full year of your journey there...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give it to me... now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! So is he sayin'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:40.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you've been to the\NGrand Line too, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:41.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My logbook, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.66,0:03:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're right, I do indeed\Nhave a record of my travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:50.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I will never hand it over to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:51.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:55.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You ignorant brute...\NThat logbook is sacred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.05,0:03:58.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the pride of the\Ncrewmen that I sailed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's far too important to give to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:04.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right... I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes... It's true that\Nthe Grand Line beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:10.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Still... I will never give up on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:15.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the end, it's just another ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had enough weapons...\Nand men... and ambition!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.49,0:04:24.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Regrettably, the only\Nthing I lacked was information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.70,0:04:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just didn't know enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:31.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But now, I'll fix all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once I have your logbook,\NI'll form another pirate fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and seize the legendary One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, I will stand as ruler\Nof this great pirate era!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Now, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's me who's gonna be\NKing of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [COOKS gasp]\N– [COOK U] Chore Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't be such an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You better back off, Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:02.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way, not from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:05.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you say something, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that kind\Nof stupidity again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:10.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, well, stupid or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:12.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just stating the\Nfacts like they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna conquer the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG growls]\NNo, you won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true that we didn't have\Nthe information we needed;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:28.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}but my fleet of five thousand men was\Nwiped out in just seven days, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:30.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That sea is hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! One week?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:35.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg's ships were\Nwiped out in seven days?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK KK] What happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:42.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't find your\Nsmart-assed remarks very amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:47.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you insist on this foolish behavior,\NI'll crush you right here and right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:52.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:54.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] I can, and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure to send you\Nto an early grave, you cocky runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Luffy?\NYou need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.93,0:06:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't need help,\Nthat's okay, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:12.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, guys. Appreciate the offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I think I can handle this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:16.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:21.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are those two guys your "crew"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty small\Ngroup you got there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not all...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got two more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not a part of your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:32.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] I'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:35.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm going to go feed my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those of you who don't wish to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:45.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,can leave the restaurant\Nnow and escape that fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:48.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only things I'm after are\Nthe logbook and this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:54.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] However, if you wish\Nto stay and be slaughtered...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:58.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no problem burying every\Nlast one of you at sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN groaning]\NI'm... so sorry, Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:09.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:13.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] You have nothing\Nto apologize for, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:18.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Every cook at this restaurant\Ndid what they thought was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to say about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you acting as if\Nyou're taking Sanji's side?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This mess is his fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK V] He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji is responsible for\Nthis whole damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:33.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Boss! That man's gonna\Nput your precious restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,out of business!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:37.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fools don't know what\Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:42.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,None of you have any idea what it's\Nlike to be on the brink of starvation...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.78,0:07:46.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To have no food or water\Non the open ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:51.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There is no way you could possibly understand\Nwhat a terrifying prospect that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:54.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the most difficult\Nsituation a man can ever face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.54,0:07:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ntalkin' about, Chef Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:01.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] If all you're gonna\Ndo is stand around grumbling,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– then leave this place\N– [COOKS gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:03.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:08.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] I, for one,\Nam gonna stay and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:11.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I couldn't live with myself\Nif I accepted defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK W] I'm staying, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:15.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, this is our\Nrestaurant, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:18.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right, and this place\Nis all I've got, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.77,0:08:24.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saw how powerful Don is, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:26.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hey, Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up because I'm only\Ngoing to say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Feeding someone who's hungry\Nis my sacred moral duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:33.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:42.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that your crew is well fed,\NI have no obligation to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:47.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}With a clean conscience, I can beat\Nevery last one of them to a bloody pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:50.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anyone tries to take the\Nrestaurant... they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.30,0:08:53.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them without a\Nmoment's hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:55.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.01,0:08:56.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Hah! You're a real\Nhead-case, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Letting him live, then\Nthreatening to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.65,0:09:03.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can it, cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] See? This guy's awesome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.69,0:09:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who cares how awesome he is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We{\i0} gotta get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.03,0:09:11.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Easy there, Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is Don Krieg, but he's\Nin pretty sad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm. Hey, Ghin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't know\Nanything about the Grand Line...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I thought you'd been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing makes any sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What happened to us on the seventh day\Nof our journey through that cursed sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:34.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it was\Na dream... or reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw things that I can't\Nbring myself to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:46.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I know in my heart that it's impossible...\Nfor that entire fifty-ship fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:51.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... to be completely\Neradicated by a single man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS gasp, whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.58,0:09:59.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2840,2840,\c&H060604&\3c&H060604&\4c&H060604&)\t(2858,3859,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}[GHIN] It all happened so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As soon as this man appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:11.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he began to systematically sink\Nour ships one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] If that raging storm\Nhadn't come upon us when it did,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then that monster would have\Ndestroyed our flagship as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] I don't know if a\Nsingle other ship made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:37.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It all seems like a terrible\Nnightmare burned into my memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.83,0:10:40.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just want to forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:46.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They were like a hawk's,\Nsharp and murderous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His gaze alone felt like\Nthe cold hand of death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What did he just say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:58.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:02.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That can only be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:05.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– known as Hawk-Eye.\N– [COOK B] What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.44,0:11:07.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Your description\Nof his heartless gaze
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,isn't proof of his identity\Nin and of itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the way he so easily\Ndecimated your fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,confirms without a\Ndoubt, that it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hawk-Eye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you know him, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:27.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the man I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:33.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SANJI] Could that man have had some\Nkind of score to settle with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.63,0:11:35.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] We didn't do anything to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:38.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Perhaps you\Ndisturbed him during a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:39.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.64,0:11:43.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would he destroy an entire\Nfleet for something so trivial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF chuckles]\NThere's no reason to shout...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:48.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you might like\Na little friendly advice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:53.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on what kind of a place\Nthe Grand Line is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what kind of place is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He probably means that\Nanything can happen there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:00.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sobs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Do we really,\Nreally have to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.08,0:12:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:07.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO, USOPP] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.25,0:12:10.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Hey... Luffy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]\NThat's so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be such a blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand\Nthe concept of "danger"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Finally, my life's goal will\Nbe achieved on the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:25.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My rival...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's out there somewhere,\Nand I'm gonna find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:34.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Are you that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:36.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's idiots like you\Nguys that end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] That may be true...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:41.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But lay off the name-calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:46.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I devoted my entire life to becoming\Nthe world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:51.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I made my choice, so I'm the only\None who gets to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.75,0:12:55.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! What about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:58.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me too, right?! I mean,\Nit only seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:03.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI sighs]\NWhat morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:09.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:13.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do any of you maggots understand\Nthe current situation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That enormous galleon moored\Nin front of our dear little
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:20.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,restaurant is none other\Nthan Don Krieg's flagship!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:24.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why don't we check back into\Nreality and deal with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:27.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] What the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:36.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]\NYeah! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.55,0:13:39.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] I can't\Nbelieve it! We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] It's like a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE C] Nightmare's finally over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.01,0:13:45.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE D] We sailed into the pirate\Ngraveyard, but we came back alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:52.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right... And I'm\Nglad you all made it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:55.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because I'll need a healthy crew\Nto go back to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:58.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:01.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... Why the long faces?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir... Why are we going back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gunshot]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.83,0:14:13.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Point taken... Are there\Nany other objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheer]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:28.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] First, we need to take\Nover that floating restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.47,0:14:32.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, we can abandon the wreck\Nwe're on before it falls apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.52,0:14:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the enemy;\Nthey're just a bunch of prissy cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:38.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It won't take much to crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:49.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Attack!\N– [PIRATES yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hear that?! They're gonna be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:54.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK C] The restaurant is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:57.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll fight to the\Ndeath to keep it that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:27.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE LL] The main ship... It was cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:32.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was cut?! What do you mean "cut"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something sliced up this galleon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way... It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:40.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS gasp, scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Raise the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or we'll sink along with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.97,0:15:49.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK H] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.97,0:15:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.18,0:15:54.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait... Nami and the guys are\Nstill on our ship out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.73,0:15:57.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP groans]\NI hope it's not too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.77,0:16:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY pants, gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:07.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.86,0:16:09.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.95,0:16:11.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yosaku! Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] What happened to the ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.83,0:16:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's Nami? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:20.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] I'm sorry, Big Bro...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.04,0:16:23.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to say\Nthis, but... she's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.51,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] See ya! Oh, and\Nmake sure to tell them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:30.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] If it's meant to be,\NI'll see them real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:34.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She took all the treasure\Nand sailed away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL] She did what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:52.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.63,0:17:09.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.47,0:17:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For real?! Nami sailed off\Nwith the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:16.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need a straight answer!\NNow, what happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:25.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(2900,3817,\c&H060605&\3c&H060605&\4c&H060605&)}Well... It all happened\Nin only a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YOSAKU] Hey, what's the matter, Big Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:35.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say, I don't really mean to pry or\Nanything, but whatcha looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.37,0:17:37.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it's nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:40.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice! Now that's a big bounty pirate...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:42.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:44.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But Big Sis...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think you're aiming a little\Ntoo high going after Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:49.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding, that\Nguy's really bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was playing it cool and\Nlaying low for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:52.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, staying out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[YOSAKU] But these days,\Nthat maniac is causing all sorts of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:18:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's kinda tough walking away from\Na twenty million berry bounty though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:02.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] That guy is so\Npowerful that there is the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.06,0:18:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,slightest, tiniest chance that\Nwe could lose and, well, die...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:10.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Big Sis Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.03,0:18:12.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, would you guys mind turning around
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:15.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,while I change into\Nsomething more comfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:16.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure... I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:18.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Changing? Like right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's so hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:22.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY gasp]\NYeah, you're hot... Uh, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:30.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you ever met a\Nwoman who's that daring?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:33.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you say we turn\Naround and see if she's done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:34.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY] Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.89,0:18:37.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp, scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.35,0:18:43.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nthink you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm doing business, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:49.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Use your heads, guys. I'm a\Nthief who only targets pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:51.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and my next score is this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:53.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I never said anything about\Nbeing a member of this crew,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:56.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was just traveling\Nwith them, nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even though I only spent a short\Ntime with Luffy and the gang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:19:01.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure had a lot of fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make sure to tell them that I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:04.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it's truly meant to be,\NI'll see them real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:12.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:17.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be in so much trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:25.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Our only job was to look after the ship,\Nand you're making us fail miserably!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:33.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFEFDFC&\4c&HFEFDFC&\t(25,943,\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}So that's the story of how\NBig Sis Nami took the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! She just had to\Nmake a bad situation worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The heartless thief!\NKaya gave us that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:43.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Wait! I see a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:46.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me where your boat is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:49.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have it moored to the restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro! Usopp! Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take their ship and go get Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:54.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down... Let her keep the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Trust me, that woman is way\Nmore trouble than she's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.14,0:20:01.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's the only person I'll\Naccept as the ship's navigator!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:07.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're one high-maintenance\Ncaptain, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:08.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, Usopp, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Uh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] The ship's\Nready for action, Big Bro Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I should probably\Nstick around here till
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:19.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I get this thing settled\Nwith the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:20.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, be careful...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.91,0:20:24.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The situation here could\Nget really bad really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:26.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] The ship has\Nbeen broken to splinters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over there! It's that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.71,0:20:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] He came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE OO gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The man who destroyed\Nour fleet is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:43.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.64,0:20:44.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[group gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's... That's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:55.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [heartbeat thumps]\N– [ZORO gulps]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[thumping continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That man is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] That son of a bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:10.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That psycho followed us back\Nhere! He's gonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:13.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:16.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] That's the man\NI've been looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hawk-Eye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:25.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:33.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... The greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:38.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be the guy\Nwho destroyed Krieg's fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.07,0:21:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He sunk fifty pirate ships out on\Nthe Grand Line all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:45.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like he came back to finish\Nthe job, but is that all he wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:49.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute... He just\Nlooks like any ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:53.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't even appear to have any\Nkind of special weapons with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.04,0:21:54.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He carries his weapon on his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:57.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY] That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.34,0:22:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[CARNE] He couldn't have destroyed a galleon\Nlike that using nothing but a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hawk-Eye Mihawk... is a true master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.85,0:22:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is without a doubt the\Ngreatest swordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.27,0:22:15.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE SS] You... You monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:16.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:18.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell have we\Never done to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:21.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] Just killing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE SS growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.70,0:22:24.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:34.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! I missed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:38.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I aimed straight for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:39.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He diverted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE SS gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:44.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He changed the course of the bullets\Nusing the tip of his sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.18,0:22:45.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE SS] That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.72,0:22:49.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Who do you think you are?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:53.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never see a sword handled\Nso gently, or with such grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:57.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no strength in\Nswordplay based on force.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:23:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Did you also use that\Nsword to slice up this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then it's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:04.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.91,0:23:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got three swords!\NIt couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:11.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I set sail for only one\Nreason... to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:12.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And what is your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:13.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK chuckles]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.17,0:23:16.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How foolish...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.35,0:23:36.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They sure were nice guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:37.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.81,0:23:39.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.11,0:23:41.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they would\Nlet me join them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.94,0:23:44.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.24,0:23:48.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Free. I just wanna be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:52.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Bell-mère.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:24:00.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You've got spare time,\Nso let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! No way! It's him! Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Zoro of the Three-Swords Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:06.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.63,0:24:09.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really? A pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:11.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.47,0:24:16.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy, we'd better hurry! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.35,0:24:19.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Going Merry{\i0} is about\Nto sail right out of sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:21.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:22.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.69,0:24:26.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a weak, pitiful creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.53,0:24:32.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] If you are in fact\Na competent swordsman,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.62,0:24:36.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you should see the disparity in our\Nabilities, even before we cross swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.79,0:24:40.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must ask you why have\Nyou challenged me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:44.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Could it be your courage?\NOr is it simply your ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My ambition drives me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.38,0:24:52.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also... I made a promise\NI intend to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.68,0:24:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The greatest swordsman in the world\Ngoing up against Roronoa Zoro...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.31,0:24:58.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Two masters of swordplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:25:00.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of a fight is\Nthis gonna turn out to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.65,0:25:04.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There isn't a person alive\Nwho can defeat Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.40,0:25:06.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's already the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.61,0:25:09.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.11,0:25:14.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Funny... What do you think\Nyou're gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.45,0:25:15.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'll be more than adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.66,0:25:18.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, you wouldn't kill\Na fly with a cannon, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.96,0:25:22.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You may have quite the\Nreputation on the East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.17,0:25:24.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This sea is by far\Nthe weakest of the four.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:32.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't carry any\Nblades smaller than this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:35.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have had just about\Nenough of your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:38.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Now, you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.10,0:25:41.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how\Nbig the world really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO] Oni Giri!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.95,0:25:52.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO gasps] What the...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.74,0:25:55.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.45,0:25:58.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Big Bro's Oni Giri was stopped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:26:02.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's crazy! That attack\Nnever fails to stop an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.33,0:26:08.25,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I can't move my swords!\NWhat has he done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.25,0:26:11.01,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No one's been able to defend\Nagainst that technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.01,0:26:13.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He stopped it with a pocketknife!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.47,0:26:16.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Th... This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.64,0:26:19.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He can't be this much better than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.06,0:26:22.06,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way our skills\Nare this far apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.27,0:26:27.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yells] I'm not that far\Nbehind the world's strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.48,0:26:31.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.49,0:26:32.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.70,0:26:33.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.91,0:26:35.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.12,0:26:37.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just toying with him,\Nright?! Fight for real, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.62,0:26:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.33,0:26:42.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't be that much better than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.83,0:26:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.05,0:26:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such ferocious swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:26:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.23,0:27:09.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[PIRATE SS] How can he defend against Zoro's\NThree-Sword Style with such a small knife?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.07,0:27:12.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE VV] He's more of a monster\Nwith a blade than even the great Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:15.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I did not devote my\Nentire life to swordsmanship...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.61,0:27:18.70,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,to be dispatched by a toy like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:27.75,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(59,726,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}You're lucky, Zoro...\Nbeing born as a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.75,0:27:29.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was to be
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:31.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,to be the world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:33.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Now promise me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:38.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Promise me that someday, one of us\Nwill be the world's greatest swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.55,0:27:39.97,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll see who gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.93,0:27:41.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.48,0:27:49.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] To become the world's strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.19,0:27:54.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.65,0:27:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.45,0:28:01.70,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I ask that you\Nlet me have that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.70,0:28:03.79,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get stronger\Nthan she ever was!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.79,0:28:06.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Strong enough that my name\Nreaches up to the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.83,0:28:10.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,340)}I am going to be the\Nworld's greatest swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.88,0:28:14.09,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,370)}I promised her... I promised...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.59,0:28:23.35,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting, panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.35,0:28:26.64,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] I will defeat this man... for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.64,0:28:31.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:32.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.73,0:28:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What weight do you carry\Nupon your shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.49,0:28:37.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Speak up, weakling!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:39.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(80,80,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)\t(139,806,\3c&H525252&\4c&H000000&)}We're deeply impressed by your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.57,0:28:41.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you let us join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.37,0:28:43.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We're the famed bounty hunting\Nduo that's fearsome enough
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.74,0:28:47.16,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,to silence a crying child\Nby a hair: Yosaku and Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.16,0:28:49.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you call him "weakling"!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.42,0:28:52.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.09,0:28:53.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY yell]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.00,0:28:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.71,0:28:56.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yosaku! Johnny! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.30,0:29:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Just stay put!\N– [YOSAKU, JOHNNY growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.18,0:29:02.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]\NNo... I won't lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.64,0:29:07.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.48,0:29:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[heartbeat thumps]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Tiger...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.95,0:29:21.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] World's greatest swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.95,0:29:24.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty good!\NThe King of the Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.03,0:29:26.54,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,wouldn't have any less\Nthan the best on his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.54,0:29:27.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO] ... Trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.60,0:29:51.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are defeated, yet\Nyou won't step back...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:53.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.73,0:29:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... I will not run...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:59.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if I retreat a single step...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.11,0:30:01.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would be shattering\Nthe promises I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.74,0:30:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't run...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.41,0:30:05.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would lose my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.24,0:30:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, without that, there\Nwould be nothing left for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.33,0:30:12.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what defeat is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:15.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chuckles]\NThen I won't accept defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.34,0:30:17.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.67,0:30:20.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.13,0:30:24.01,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] A strong heart indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.01,0:30:26.72,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,He chooses death before defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.72,0:30:27.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:31.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir... State your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.94,0:30:38.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am... Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.65,0:30:39.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] I'll remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.90,0:30:43.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one as strong as you has\Ncome around in quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.86,0:30:46.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So as a swordsman's courtesy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.70,0:30:50.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll use the world's strongest\Nblack sword to finish you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.58,0:30:53.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you... I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE A] Look! He took it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.54,0:30:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE B] That's the sword\Nthat sliced up the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.67,0:31:00.34,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] So this is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.34,0:31:03.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Will it be the world's\Nstrongest... or death?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.68,0:31:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.43,0:31:10.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Enough, Big Bro! Stop it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:12.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fad(150,150)}[ZORO] Three-Sword Style Secret Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.65,0:31:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.56,0:31:18.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[ZORO] Three Thousand Worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.11,0:31:27.62,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I've lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.12,0:31:32.29,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Never in my life\Ndid I imagine I'd lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.08,0:31:37.21,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] So this is the power\Nof the greatest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.75,0:31:41.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.05,0:31:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Scars on the back are\Na swordsman's shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.01,0:31:46.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.60,0:31:56.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.19,0:32:01.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] You shouldn't rush\Nthese things, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.44,0:32:04.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.11,0:32:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY] Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:09.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:11.08,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.24,0:32:16.91,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZORO] I devoted my entire life to becoming\Nthe world's greatest swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.91,0:32:20.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It was my choice, so I'm the only\None who gets to call me stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:23.50,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:26.17,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,His opponent was way out of his league!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.17,0:32:28.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How this fight would end\Nwas clear from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.47,0:32:29.93,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why choose death?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.93,0:32:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.51,0:32:33.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give up your ambition and live!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.64,0:32:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is the power of the\NGrand Line; it's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.11,0:32:44.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Pirate Hunter Zoro was as\Nhelpless as a newborn baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Damn you...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.74,0:32:49.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY] Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.91,0:32:55.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.70,0:32:57.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must be some kind of freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.83,0:32:59.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.12,0:33:03.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that loudmouthed little twerp\Nhas the power of a devil fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:04.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.51,0:33:09.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] Are you\Nthat young warrior's comrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.38,0:33:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed with you\Nfor not interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.60,0:33:18.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] There's nothing\Nto be upset about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.77,0:33:20.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your friend will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:21.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.23,0:33:23.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Big Bro! Say something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.69,0:33:25.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.90,0:33:26.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.86,0:33:27.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:29.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's hurry up and\Nget him out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.66,0:33:33.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I've got some medicine! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.82,0:33:36.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's still far too\Nearly for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.58,0:33:39.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Hawk-Eye Mihawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.91,0:33:42.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're strong but there\Nis much for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.96,0:33:46.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter how many years it\Ntakes, I will hold this title as
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.00,0:33:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the greatest in the world,\Nand wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until that day, you\Nmust hone your skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.97,0:33:55.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... seek {\i1}me{\i0} out! Roronoa Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.89,0:33:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.14,0:33:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU, JOHNNY] Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:04.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not just anyone can earn\Nthe regard of Hawk-Eye Mihawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MIHAWK] You...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:08.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}your{\i0} goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:10.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To be the King!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your ambitions are even\Nloftier than your friend's.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.07,0:34:14.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's quite a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.28,0:34:17.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you just let\Nme worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.03,0:34:18.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.45,0:34:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.12,0:34:21.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was just unconscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:22.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:25.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're alive, then say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.33,0:34:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.25,0:34:27.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[YOSAKU] Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.09,0:34:30.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.38,0:34:32.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.26,0:34:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.60,0:34:37.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for disappointing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.56,0:34:41.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I know that you need nothing less than\Nthe greatest swordsman in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.68,0:34:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've let you down...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.69,0:34:45.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.69,0:34:50.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay! You can\Nstop saying things now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:52.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] I solemnly swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.61,0:34:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From this moment forward...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.36,0:34:57.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That I will never lose again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:34:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO chokes]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.45,0:35:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until the day comes... when\NI defeat him and take his title...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.54,0:35:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will never... never be defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:12.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that okay... King of the Pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.18,0:35:18.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs] Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.14,0:35:19.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.93,0:35:21.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope to see you again... someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] Hey! Hawk-Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.98,0:35:29.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was under the impression that\Nyou had come here to take my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.90,0:35:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weren't you here to kill Don\NKrieg, ruler of the East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.86,0:35:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The thought had crossed my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.99,0:35:39.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I've had enough fun for today,\Nso I'm going home to get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.78,0:35:41.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.62,0:35:43.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't even gotten started.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:44.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, but, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.71,0:35:47.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not a good idea\Nto try to keep him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.80,0:35:53.13,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1397,0,1,\c&HF3F4F2&\3c&HF3F4F2&\4c&HF3F4F2&)}[MIHAWK] He just won't learn, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.47,0:35:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.14,0:36:03.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn... He escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.64,0:36:04.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.68,0:36:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS scream]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:13.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.69,0:36:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.69,0:36:16.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.07,0:36:17.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll leave Nami to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.91,0:36:18.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.66,0:36:20.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.07,0:36:21.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro and I are gonna\Nget her right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.99,0:36:24.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And make sure you get that\Ncook to join our crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.62,0:36:29.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And then... on the {\i1}Going Merry{\i0},\Nthe five of us'll set sail... to the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.92,0:36:32.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughs]\NYeah! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.17,0:36:33.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[KRIEG] All right, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.17,0:36:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We ran into a little distraction from\Nour plan, but the real fight starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.34,0:36:39.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.01,0:36:40.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.14,0:36:44.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[LUFFY] Hey, Pops, can I stop doing these\Nchores if I get those pirates outta here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.85,0:36:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Suit yourself.
Comment: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:16.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=13}===============================DIALOGUE============================
